      "content": "That makes sense, but it's still a bit general. Can you dive deeper into the specific \"moral decay\" part? Like, when they talk about the \"sanctity\" being eroded or the \"destabilization\" of society, what is the actual logic they use to connect modern family definitions to a breakdown of civilization? I want to understand the gravity of how they view it.",
